This adaptation:
  - keeps the three-stage co-authoring workflow (context → refinement → reader check)
  - removes host-specific tool assumptions (artifacts, create_file, str_replace,
    Claude.ai connectors, Slack/Drive/SharePoint integrations, claude.ai reader testing)
  - rewrites steps against this platform's knowledge, table, todo, and citation tools

